question_text:
State the returned value of check_upload below for each call: (i)check_upload("A.TXT", 1024),(ii)check_upload("a.pdf", 900),(iii)check_upload("b.csv", 1025),(iv)check_upload("c.exe", 2000).

def check_upload(name,size):
    errors=[]
    extension=name.rsplit(".",1)[-1].lower()
    if extension not in ["csv","txt"]:
        errors.append("type")
    if size > 1024:
        errors.append("size")
    if not errors:
        return "Accepted"
    return errors
